{"id":"normalmente","lemma":"normalmente","pos":"adv","rank":1202,"glosses":["normally; usually; most of the time; customarily"],"ipa":"/noɾˈmalˌmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-normalmente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Normalmente me levanto tarde.","en":"I usually get up late.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454016"},{"text":"Normalmente no cometo errores.","en":"I usually don't make mistakes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567170"},{"text":"¿Normalmente llegas temprano o tarde?","en":"Are you usually early or late?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460022"},{"text":"Normalmente me levanto a las ocho.","en":"I usually get up at 8.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568198"},{"text":"Normalmente estoy de acuerdo con ella.","en":"I usually agree with her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39123"}]}